{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xvrf6JNaQmGLgup4U2ggzJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{+The plan modes are a spec's: `pose close <scope> --plan|--apply|--resume` on a milestone or a roadmap exits 2 and says so. Any other scope closes with `pose close <scope>` and no plan flag (the guarded transition: it verifies the gate, which on a large repository takes minutes, and names the next closeout, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` once every milestone of a roadmap is closed); `pose closeout-check <scope>` reads whether it is terminal and is what `terminal=true` means for a milestone or a roadmap.+}\n{+Os modos de plano são os de uma spec: `pose close <escopo> --plan|--apply|--resume` num milestone ou num roadmap sai com 2 e diz isso. Qualquer outro escopo fecha com `pose close <escopo>` e nenhuma flag de plano (a transição guardada: verifica o gate, o que num repositório grande leva minutos, e nomeia o próximo fechamento, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` quando todos os milestones de um roadmap estão fechados); `pose closeout-check <escopo>` lê se está terminal e é o que `terminal=true` significa para um milestone ou um roadmap.+}\n{+The plan modes are a spec's: `pose close <scope> --plan|--apply|--resume` on a milestone or a roadmap exits 2 and says so. Any other scope closes with `pose close <scope>` and no plan flag (the guarded transition: it verifies the gate, which on a large repository takes minutes, and names the next closeout, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` once every milestone of a roadmap is closed); `pose closeout-check <scope>` reads whether it is terminal and is what `terminal=true` means for a milestone or a roadmap.+}\n{+Os modos de plano são os de uma spec: `pose close <escopo> --plan|--apply|--resume` num milestone ou num roadmap sai com 2 e diz isso. Qualquer outro escopo fecha com `pose close <escopo>` e nenhuma flag de plano (a transição guardada: verifica o gate, o que num repositório grande leva minutos, e nomeia o próximo fechamento, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` quando todos os milestones de um roadmap estão fechados); `pose closeout-check <escopo>` lê se está terminal e é o que `terminal=true` significa para um milestone ou um roadmap.+}\n POSE.md                                               | 2 +-\n locales/pt-BR/POSE.md                                 | 2 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md               | 2 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md | 2 +-\n 4 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"62959648-6a3f-4ad4-8620-32a0e11ba787","timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:21:50.666Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{+The plan modes are a spec's: `pose close <scope> --plan|--apply|--resume` on a milestone or a roadmap exits 2 and says so. Any other scope closes with `pose close <scope>` and no plan flag (the guarded transition: it verifies the gate, which on a large repository takes minutes, and names the next closeout, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` once every milestone of a roadmap is closed); `pose closeout-check <scope>` reads whether it is terminal and is what `terminal=true` means for a milestone or a roadmap.+}\n{+Os modos de plano são os de uma spec: `pose close <escopo> --plan|--apply|--resume` num milestone ou num roadmap sai com 2 e diz isso. Qualquer outro escopo fecha com `pose close <escopo>` e nenhuma flag de plano (a transição guardada: verifica o gate, o que num repositório grande leva minutos, e nomeia o próximo fechamento, `pose close roadmap:<slug>` quando todos os milestones de um roadmap estão fechados); `pose closeout-check <escopo>` lê se está terminal e é o que `terminal=true` significa para um milestone ou um roadmap.+}\n{+The plan modes are a spec's: `pose close <scope> --plan|--apply|--resume` on a milestone or a roadmap exits 2 and says so. Any other scope closes with `pose close <scope>` and no plan flag (the guarded transition: it verifies t